lowlist entries keep their exact names, resolved relative to the agent working directory. The Dockerfile's existing `COPY agent/ /agent/` ships them.\n- **Script contracts are frozen in `docs/observation-scripts.md`.** A behavior change updates that page in the same change.\n- **No Go change for env.** `CLAUDE_ENV` / `ClaudeEnvRaw` in both entry points stays exactly as it is.\n- No change to the `github.com/bborbe/agent` module.\n- `k8s/defect-diagnoser-agent-config.yaml` keeps its \"NOT APPLIED\" header. Only `ALLOWED_TOOLS`, the env keys and the path-3 comments change.\n- `agent/.claude/CLAUDE.md` § Forbidden is unchanged.\n- Existing tests keep passing; healthcheck / oauth-probe routing untouched.\n- Every prompt ends with `make precommit` as its verification gate; prompts 1 and 2 also run `make test` iteratively.\n- AC12 is OPERATOR-executable (host, after merge) — it is not part of any YOLO prompt's verification. Make that explicit in prompt 3.\n\n## Output\n\nWrite the prompt files into `prompts/`. Return a summary of: files created (with full relative paths), the decomposition decisions you made, any deviations from the spec's Suggested Decomposition, and any open questions you surfaced as comments inside the prompts."}}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31f2fa85-d626-41fe-b66d-5257d5b0f933","uuid":"ae7e9d1b-959e-450a-86bd-ce5b9bec12de","timestamp":"2026-09-27T22:27:25.229Z"}
