\n\t\"testing\"\n\t\"time\"\n\n\t. \"github.com/onsi/ginkgo/v2\"\n\t. \"github.com/onsi/gomega\"\n\t\"github.com/onsi/gomega/format\"\n)\n\nfunc TestSuite(t *testing.T) {\n\ttime.Local = time.UTC\n\tformat.TruncatedDiff = false\n\tRegisterFailHandler(Fail)\n\tsuiteConfig, reporterConfig := GinkgoConfiguration()\n\tsuiteConfig.Timeout = 60 * time.Second\n\tRunSpecs(t, \"Factory Suite\", suiteConfig, reporterConfig)\n}\n=== observation-scripts env section ===\n9:## How the scripts get their env\n11:The Claude runner passes only `HOME,PATH,USER,TZ,ZONEINFO,TMPDIR,LANG,LC_ALL` from the pod into the Claude subprocess. `GIT_REST_URL` and `PROMETHEUS_URL` reach the scripts through the existing `CLAUDE_ENV` channel (comma-separated `KEY=VALUE`, merged into `ClaudeRunnerConfig.Env` by both entry points):\n13:- in-cluster: Config `spec.env.CLAUDE_ENV: \"GIT_REST_URL=http://vault-obsidian-personal:9090,PROMETHEUS_URL=http://prometheus.monitoring:9090\"`\n14:- local CLI: `-claude-env='GIT_REST_URL=…,PROMETHEUS_URL=…'`\n16:At `-v=2` the runner logs `cmd.Env = [...]`; both keys appear there when forwarding works.\n25:| Missing env var | non-zero exit; stderr names the variable (`<VAR> is required`) |\n27:| Env | only the variable named below; no defaulted (`${VAR:-…}`) env knobs, no gateway secret, no tokens |\n34:- Request: `GET ${GIT_REST_URL}/api/v1/files/<encoded path>`.\n35:- Env: `GIT_REST_URL`.\n40:- Request: `GET ${GIT_REST_URL}/api/v1/files/` with query parameter `glob=<glob>` (URL-encoded).\n42:- Env: `GIT_REST_URL`.\n48:- Request: `GET ${PROMETHEUS_URL}/api/v1/query` with query parameter `query=<promql>` (URL-encoded). The path is fixed; no other Prometheus path is reachable. No `time` parameter — Prometheus evaluates at its own now.\n49:- Env: `PROMETHEUS_URL`.\n59:- Clone root is fixed: the `repos/` directory beside `scripts/` (`/agent/repos` in the image; `agent/repos/` in a local checkout, gitignored). No env override.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a4e0b50fe9e7202f","session_id":"31f2fa85-d626-41fe-b66d-5257d5b0f933","uuid":"409557f5-23dd-4651-9fe0-19d2ce43a78a","timestamp":"2026-09-27T22:44:06.642Z","subagent_type":"dark-factory:prompt-auditor","task_description":"Audit prompt 3"}
